[355.782757, "o", "MEMORY: Engineering document 2: Database migration guide. Run npm run db:migrate to apply the latest migrations to your PostgreSQL database.\r\nMEMORY: {\"# Document B (zrthdq6dz6)\":\"Engineering v2 changelog: refactored auth, switched to the new build system, upgraded the database driver. Marker: docB.\"}\r\nMEMORY: Bob verified the staging environment is healthy after the migration\r\nMEMORY: Alice deployed the Q3 Kubernetes migration plan on Friday\r\nMEMORY: Vector databases such as Pinecone, Weaviate, and pgvector store high-dimensional embeddings and support approximate nearest neighbor search. They power semantic retrieval over unstructured text, images, and code by mapping content into a shared embedding space.\r\n"]
